{"3871180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "One more gem", "steam_appid": 3871180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One more gem </strong>is a love letter for all the classic retro games <br>similar to <strong>Supaplex</strong> or <strong>Rocks'n'Diamonds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience solving intricate puzzles featuring new game elements,<br>all with modern graphics and a lot of shiny gems to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/a7693ee68b7fe231b649e2854e29b8dd.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as either ⬩<strong>Moss</strong>⬩ or ⬩<strong>Pebla</strong>⬩, protectors of their realm, <br>in a world where chaos broke out.<br>Follow the path of gems and help the realm heal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.webp?t=1766256026\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.poster.avif?t=1766256026\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The perilous worlds can be tackled in a multitude of ways<br>and they all come with additional bonus challenges,<br>featuring Steam achievements to boast your skills to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you become and expert you can come back to the same levels<br>and try to collect all gems as some of them are placed in challenging or tricky places,<br>making the original levels replayable and gives you a sense of accomplishment<br>when collecting all the possible gems in a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/76da7fccdd0686c9e5e0f8cccbf0c728.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The places you'll explore are not empty though,<br>they are filled with hungry monsters that are ready to hunt you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gradually as you progress the game introduces more elements<br>and more enemies for you to understand and tackle.<br>Initially you meet simple monsters with predictable movements,<br>while you progress the monsters are still predictable<br>but challenge your reaction time and logic in the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/4d1946652f36810f10f1d09c04608fff.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game features 7 level sets each,<br>with up to 20 levels in a total of 130 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some of the levels feature a boss puzzle where you have to tackle a snaking conundrum<br>that bends the original game mechanics in interesting ways.<br>There are eight types of snakes and worm, some are interesting, some are disgusting<br>but all of them bring interesting mechanics that keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/c46375ece2b2f1bf2402de40d0b6ff55.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You always have one more gem to collect.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Using the integrated level editor and sharing through Steam<br>you can share your levels with your friends<br>and challenge each other with your own creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/98f3b1b0ce3906554c930227ff34e6b0.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=325 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">˗ˋˏ <strong>Game features </strong>ˎˊ˗</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Shiny modern graphics ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Smooth control ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Rewind time ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ <strong>130 Levels</strong> ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Multiple paths for levels ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Bonus challenges ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Eight music tracks ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Animated cutscenes ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Interesting NPCs ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Six monsters ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Eight snakes ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ 56 game elements ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ <strong>Level editor</strong> ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ Steam achievements ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">✦ One more gem ✦</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/b8d71a3fefe1f0c5a5a11f4541d244b8.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One more gem </strong>is a love letter for all the classic retro games <br>similar to <strong>Supaplex</strong> or <strong>Rocks'n'Diamonds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experience solving intricate puzzles featuring new game elements,<br>all with modern graphics and a lot of shiny gems to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/a7693ee68b7fe231b649e2854e29b8dd.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=253 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">You play as either ⬩<strong>Moss</strong>⬩ or ⬩<strong>Pebla</strong>⬩, protectors of their realm, <br>in a world where chaos broke out.<br>Follow the path of gems and help the realm heal.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.webp?t=1766256026\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/144bf8446fadaaa9a324c5b5f2696795.poster.avif?t=1766256026\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The perilous worlds can be tackled in a multitude of ways<br>and they all come with additional bonus challenges,<br>featuring Steam achievements to boast your skills to your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you become and expert you can come back to the same levels<br>and try to collect all gems as some of them are placed in challenging or tricky places,<br>making the original levels replayable and gives you a sense of accomplishment<br>when collecting all the possible gems in a level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/76da7fccdd0686c9e5e0f8cccbf0c728.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The places you'll explore are not empty though,<br>they are filled with hungry monsters that are ready to hunt you.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gradually as you progress the game introduces more elements<br>and more enemies for you to understand and tackle.<br>Initially you meet simple monsters with predictable movements,<br>while you progress the monsters are still predictable<br>but challenge your reaction time and logic in the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871180/extras/4d1946652f36810f10f1d09c04608fff.avif?t=1766256026\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game features 7 level sets each,<br>with up to 20 levels in a total of 130 levels.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-alig